WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.766
Wide form is useful when categories are stable and
users want side-by-side comparison A

00:00:06.793 --> 00:00:12.975
scorecard with January February and March columns is
easy to scan A

00:00:12.989 --> 00:00:18.525
grade matrix can place courses in fixed columns But
wide schemas

00:00:18.552 --> 00:00:21.802
become harder to maintain when categories change
frequently
